{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>Upon the mountaintops</b> — the meaning of ראשי is in the construct state, and likewise על הגבעות יזבחו — they say to the priests of Baal that they should sacrifice. And because the men go out to burn incense outside the cities, the daughters and daughters-in-law remain in the houses; therefore they commit harlotry."], :book :hosea, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Hosea -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=15&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:50:07.930459561Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}